t[8693]={d="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, $N.  I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, $c.$B$BI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course.  I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.$B$BI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="Leve 1 Clâmide Marcial Qiraji, 2 Ídolos Lazúli, 5 Escaravelhos de Bronze e 5 Escaravelhos de Marfim para Keyl Garralesta em Silithus. Também é necessário ser <Reverenciado/Reverenciada> pelo Círculo Cenariano para concluir a missão."}
